    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// \"Build Scheduling Prompt\" -- new node for workflow 14's scheduling branch.\n// Combines the new email, recent conversation history (if any), and real\n// available slots, and asks Claude to decide whether this is a fresh\n// scheduling request or a confirmation of a previously offered time.\nconst trigger = $('When Executed by Another Workflow').first().json;\nconst availability = $('Execute: Check Availability').first().json;\nconst slots = availability.available_slots || [];\n\nlet history = '';\ntry {\n  const messages = $('Get Recent Messages').all().map(item => item.json);\n  if (messages.length > 0) {\n    history = messages\n      .map(m => `${m.role}: ${m.content}`)\n      .join('\\n\\n');\n  }\n} catch (e) {\n  // No prior messages (brand new conversation) -- treat as a fresh request.\n}\n\nconst slotsText = slots.length > 0\n  ? slots.slice(0, 8).map(s => `- ${s.starts_at} to ${s.ends_at}`).join('\\n')\n  : 'No open slots found in the checked date range.';\n\nconst prompt = `You are handling a scheduling email for a real estate agency.\n\n${history ? `Recent conversation history:\\n${history}\\n\\n` : 'This is the first message in the conversation.\\n\\n'}New customer email:\nSubject: ${trigger.subject}\nBody: ${trigger.body}\n\nCurrently available viewing slots (UTC):\n${slotsText}\n\nDecide one of three things:\n1. \"propose\" -- the customer is asking about availability but hasn't confirmed a specific time yet. Draft a reply listing 3-4 of the available slots above in a friendly, readable way (convert to a natural format, don't just paste raw ISO timestamps), asking them to pick one.\n2. \"confirm\" -- the customer's message clearly confirms one specific time that was previously offered in the conversation history AND that time is still in the available slots list above. Draft a reply confirming their requested time has been noted and that the team will finalize it shortly. Extract the exact starts_at and ends_at (in ISO 8601 UTC) for the confirmed slot from the available slots list.\n3. \"clarify\" -- ambiguous, or the customer referenced a time that is NOT in the available slots list (e.g. already booked or outside hours). Draft a reply explaining that time isn't available and offering the current real alternatives instead.\n\nRespond with ONLY valid JSON, no other text:\n{\n  \"action\": \"propose\" | \"confirm\" | \"clarify\",\n  \"confirmed_slot\": { \"starts_at\": \"<ISO 8601 UTC>\", \"ends_at\": \"<ISO 8601 UTC>\" } | null,\n  \"draft_body\": \"<the email reply body text>\"\n}`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { ...trigger, prompt } }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        208,
        -128
      ],
      "id": "00be8931-2b79-465e-89d5-e232e3b5b9a9",
      "name": "Build Scheduling Prompt"
