        "jsCode": "// \"Parse Scheduling Result\" -- parses Claude's structured scheduling\n// decision and reshapes it to match what \"Shape Draft Record\" already\n// expects downstream (content[0].text for the draft body), plus carries\n// proposed_appointment through as an extra field.\nlet raw = '';\ntry {\n  raw = $json.content[0].text;\n} catch (e) {\n  throw new Error('Unexpected Claude scheduling response shape: ' + JSON.stringify($json));\n}\n\nconst cleaned = raw.replace(/```json|```/g, '').trim();\n\nlet parsed;\ntry {\n  parsed = JSON.parse(cleaned);\n} catch (e) {\n  throw new Error('Failed to parse scheduling JSON: ' + cleaned);\n}\n\nconst ALLOWED_ACTIONS = ['propose', 'confirm', 'clarify'];\nif (!ALLOWED_ACTIONS.includes(parsed.action)) {\n  parsed.action = 'clarify';\n}\n\n// Only trust confirmed_slot when the action is actually \"confirm\" -- avoids\n// accidentally booking something from a malformed/ambiguous response.\nconst proposedAppointment = parsed.action === 'confirm' && parsed.confirmed_slot\n  ? { starts_at: parsed.confirmed_slot.starts_at, ends_at: parsed.confirmed_slot.ends_at }\n  : null;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    content: [{ type: 'text', text: parsed.draft_body || '' }],\n    proposed_appointment: proposedAppointment\n  }\n}];"
      },
